                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start">
                  <span
                    class="w-7 h-7 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                    >2</span
                  >
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-sm text-base-content">
                      Pilih Perangkat Tertaut
